{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "url": "/assets/data/open-weights-runs.json"
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "filter": "isValid(datum.cost)"
    }
  ],
  "spacing": 0,
  "facet": {
    "field": "harness",
    "type": "nominal",
    "title": null,
    "sort": [
      "Shell",
      "Incalmo",
      "Artemis"
    ],
    "columns": 3,
    "header": {
      "labelExpr": "''",
      "labelPadding": 0
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "width": 240,
    "height": 300,
    "layer": [
      {
        "_comment": [
          "Rings Incalmo only - the harness the post is arguing for. Its sides land",
          "in the two gutters, where the dividers used to be, just turned up and",
          "joined at the ends.",
          "Reaching into the gutter counts towards the panel's bounds, and the facet",
          "layout (bounds:full) then widens the gutter to match - so the offset and",
          "the gutter chase each other. -26 with spacing 0 is the fixed point that",
          "measurement settles on: ~50px gutters with the sides centred in them to",
          "within the stroke's own width. Re-measure if either changes.",
          "Vertically there is no such chase any more: the panel name is a mark",
          "inside the plot area and the x axis is pulled inside it too (see the",
          "negative axis offset below), so nothing outside the panel is positioned",
          "off these bounds - only the legend, which simply moves down."
        ],
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "n"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "harness"
            ]
          },
          {
            "filter": "datum.harness === 'Incalmo'"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "rect",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "fill": null,
          "stroke": "$hairline-strong",
          "strokeWidth": 1.5,
          "x": {
            "expr": "-26"
          },
          "x2": {
            "expr": "child_width + 26"
          },
          "y": {
            "expr": "-14"
          },
          "y2": {
            "expr": "child_height + 18"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "meanCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "stdev",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "stdCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "meanGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "stdev",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "stdGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "runs"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "model",
              "harness"
            ]
          },
          {
            "calculate": "max(0, datum.meanCost - datum.stdCost)",
            "as": "x0"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "datum.meanCost + datum.stdCost",
            "as": "x1"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "max(0, datum.meanGoals - datum.stdGoals)",
            "as": "y0"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "min(100, datum.meanGoals + datum.stdGoals)",
            "as": "y1"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "rect",
          "opacity": 0.22,
          "strokeWidth": 1
        },
        "encoding": {
          "x": {
            "field": "x0",
            "type": "quantitative"
          },
          "x2": {
            "field": "x1"
          },
          "y": {
            "field": "y0",
            "type": "quantitative"
          },
          "y2": {
            "field": "y1"
          },
          "color": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Model",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": {
              "orient": "bottom",
              "direction": "horizontal",
              "columns": 0
            }
          },
          "stroke": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": null
          },
          "tooltip": [
            {
              "field": "model",
              "title": "Model"
            },
            {
              "field": "harness",
              "title": "Harness"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanCost",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": "$,.2f",
              "title": "Mean cost / run"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanGoals",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f",
              "title": "Mean % goals achieved"
            },
            {
              "field": "runs",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Runs"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "meanCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "meanGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "runs"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "model",
              "harness",
              "env",
              "hosts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "calculate": "datum.env + ' (' + datum.hosts + ')'",
            "as": "envLabel"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "point",
          "filled": true,
          "size": 70,
          "opacity": 0.8
        },
        "encoding": {
          "x": {
            "field": "meanCost",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "Cost",
            "scale": {
              "zero": true
            },
            "axis": {
              "format": "$,.0f",
              "tickCount": 4,
              "offset": -46
            }
          },
          "y": {
            "field": "meanGoals",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "% goals achieved",
            "scale": {
              "domain": [
                -22,
                116
              ]
            },
            "axis": {
              "values": [
                0,
                20,
                40,
                60,
                80,
                100
              ],
              "domain": false
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Model",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": {
              "orient": "bottom",
              "direction": "horizontal",
              "columns": 0
            }
          },
          "tooltip": [
            {
              "field": "model",
              "title": "Model"
            },
            {
              "field": "harness",
              "title": "Harness"
            },
            {
              "field": "envLabel",
              "title": "Environment"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanCost",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": "$,.2f",
              "title": "Mean cost / run"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanGoals",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f",
              "title": "Mean % goals achieved"
            },
            {
              "field": "runs",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Runs"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "_comment": [
          "The panel name, in pixel coordinates inside the plot area.",
          "Anything drawn outside it pushes Vega's own labels further out,",
          "so this is the only place a mark and a title can share a box."
        ],
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "n"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "harness"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "text",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "baseline": "middle",
          "align": "center",
          "color": "$ink",
          "x": {
            "expr": "child_width / 2"
          },
          "y": {
            "expr": "16"
          }
        },
        "encoding": {
          "text": {
            "field": "harness"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "_fitPanels": 3
}
